g2p_en neural grapheme-to-phoneme predictor
Copyright Kyubyong Park & Jongseok Kim (https://github.com/Kyubyong/g2p), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this directory). checkpoint20.npz is copied unchanged from the
g2p_en 2.1.0 wheel; the GRU inference code in __init__.py is adapted from g2p_en/g2p.py.

Why vendored (HearNarro, 2026-10-16): the g2p_en distribution declares `distance` (GPL) and
`nltk` (and downloads NLTK corpora at import time). Only the numpy predictor is needed for
out-of-vocabulary words; the CMU dictionary, POS tagger and number expansion are not used
(misaki's lexicon covers in-vocabulary words).
